"fire-and-forget：不注册 ``_pending_turns``、不等待任何回合； 返回值仅是消息 id，可用于 "
":meth:`cancel_queued` 撤回。"
msgstr ""

#: flowing.agent.Agent.message:24 of
msgid ""
"入队时序（``before_enqueue`` → enqueue → ``after_enqueue``）与 "
":meth:`enqueue_message` 完全一致；``Intercepted`` 原样上抛。"
msgstr ""

#: flowing.agent.Agent.message:26 of
