#: flowing.runtime.Runtime.get_plugin:8 of
msgid ""
"``strict=True`` （默认）：抛 ``KeyError``——直接用写法 "
"（``runtime.get_plugin(\"cron\").plugin_dir``），未安装时立即以 清晰异常失败，而非延迟到 "
"``None.plugin_dir`` 的 ``AttributeError``；"
msgstr ""

#: flowing.runtime.Runtime.get_plugin:12 of
msgid ""
"``strict=False``：返回 ``None``——探测写法 （``if runtime.get_plugin(\"skill\", "
"strict=False) is not None: ...``）。"
msgstr ""

#: flowing.runtime.Runtime.get_plugin:15 of
msgid ""
"默认取 ``True``：探测是有意主动触发的存在性检查，显式写 ``strict=False`` 是意图的自我声明；「直接用」是更常见的形态， "
"应享受更短的写法与更响亮的失败。"
msgstr ""

#: flowing.runtime.Runtime.get_plugin:32 of
